{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"looking exausted, like he been hard at work for hours he says \"I am sorry for your loss......\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T18:48:58.551000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738830586168475709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Thank you, I'm sorry for yours as well. Its just as hard to lose a good friend.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T18:51:25.467000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738831202378580008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"she was the first of my new school..... family.... her and navar....\"  he recomposes himself, and moves from solemn to serious \"I want you to know... Someday.... maybe years from now.... I will bring them back.... until then.... we have our new school to look to.\"  pauses a moment \"some of her last words to me were concern for you.... I reassured her, i would pursue our friendship even if you forced me out\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T18:55:22.415000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738832196210524160","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Don't plan on pushing anyone out. Its not what she would have wanted. Its not what she wants for me. I plan on living my life from here on out the way she would have wanted me too. To honor her and her memories.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:02:59.766000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738834114479784016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Its what we all need more then anything right now. Friends.... no a family to lean on in our time of need.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:03:40.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738834285607256095","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
