{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"(not a problem..... i have a feeling this is a slow thoughtful conversation anyway... not rapid paced)","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:05:35.178000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738834766324826214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Live your life for you, but honor her memory....\" slowly eats the toast","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:07:06.389000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738835148891619431","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Sometimes.... I think I have been cursed...\" takes a slow bite thinking bout the words \"every community I join.... leaves me behind....\" sip of cool clean water \"but I move forward, with loss after loss..... I have to have faith someday it will get better.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:09:16.535000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738835694763507762","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"takes a few to eat in silence, finding comfort in being near a friend.","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:11:03.307000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738836142597734571","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I have thought that sometimes of my life too. With things I have done and things that have happened to me. In my line of work you get left behind and suffer loos to. Thats why it has been so hard for me to open up to everyone. Amara tried so hard. I'm disappointed it took her death to get me to realize I couldn't live my life like that anymore.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:18:55.667000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738838123819040800","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
